## Summary

Implements a layered architecture pattern for API routes to improve separation of concerns, testability, and maintainability.

## Changes

### 1. New Controller Layer (`src/controllers/`)
- Created `src/controllers/mcp/keys.controller.ts` - MCP API key validation and response formatting
- Created `src/controllers/settings/controller.ts` - Session validation, request parsing
- Added barrel files (index.ts) for exports

### 2. New Repository Layer (`src/repositories/`)
- Created `src/repositories/mcp/api-keys.repository.ts` - ORM operations with interface
- Created `src/repositories/settings/*.repository.ts` - Profile, account, display, notifications
- Added barrel files for all repositories

### 3. Service Layer Updates (`src/services/`)
- Updated settings services to use repositories
- Created `src/services/mcp/api-keys.service.ts` - Business logic layer
- Added shared types file

### 4. HTTP Layer Updates (`src/routes/api/`)
- Updated MCP keys route to use controller + service
- Updated Settings routes (profile, account, display, notifications)
- Extracted session validation to controllers

### 5. Documentation Updates
- Updated `README.md` with API Architecture section and diagram
- Created `knowledge/TASK.md` - Task tracking
- Created `knowledge/DECISION.md` - Architecture decision document
- Updated `knowledge/PLAN.md` - Added Phase 11
- Updated `docs/getting-started/architecture.md`
- Updated `docs/api/overview.md`
- Updated `AGENTS.md` with API architecture pattern instructions

## Quality Checks

- ✅ TypeScript typecheck passes (0 errors)
